  "containerMembers": "Exactly one [Content_Types].xml and one root relationship member; relationship members belong only to roles with edges. No empty or orphan relationship member. Optional roles require their corresponding optional edge.",
  "invariants": [
    "No member outside required roles, optional roles and their OPC container members.",
    "Every internal relationship target resolves to its declared role; no external relationships or unknown edges.",
    "Every part has its role content type; overrides resolve to existing parts and have unique PartName values; defaults have unique extensions.",
    "Relationship IDs are unique within each owning relationship member; slide IDs are positive and unique; the slide list and relationship targets correspond exactly.",
    "Master layout-list and presentation master-list IDs resolve to the required edges without duplicate or dangling entries.",
    "The single title layout supplies title and subtitle placeholders. Each authored slide has exactly the requested text and no other visible text.",
    "No notes, media, charts, external-link parts, macros or extra layouts/masters/slides. Tables occur only when explicitly requested.",
    "EMU table geometry is exact; unspecified deck page geometry and inert support payload defaults may differ across producers."
  ]
